    {
      "uid": "zhcn:721c2688e6e9c4da667c60ff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某天，训练员遇见千明代表的父母。\n他称赞千明代表自由的特质，\n并因为尊重她的价值观而获得两人的感谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7185873f143e73ed52f915766f0292ecf98813238808df3e19c095c70520b2a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
