    {
      "uid": "zhcn:561cf6a2fa98a6a1b0212e39",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在接受杂志采访时，\n训练员被问到对千明代表的印象后，\n回答表示她在这一年里拓展了他的世界。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d8112ecd6e10d9f9c3c26dc6d8459137be2ce2bdf016bcc9f827c6b239b041f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
