      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:625937111b90057776752ef4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当天的回程路上，千明代表说\n她不觉得自己能像其他赛马娘那样，\n为了别人而跑──",
      "source_fingerprint": "14b19e484312ff375f3b7d411f928c2b343dfa8b7ef03f1fd0537e808c801a51",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eaca822ead845d050c839d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a24019d7c41c10fecc96d2b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她觉得这样的自己，\n或许欠缺了什么重要的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0782af393e8321660597eb97154fd50a32f94cddd0d76138c93e4ac31d3aa0ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
