    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8afacd998035b712cd8053e7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "透过多项目竞技大赛，\n千明代表、鲁道夫象征和葛城王牌\n在同一场比赛激烈竞争。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45b757d3276aeff7b606d8ed5a4f0c4398daf2504554edb03ed7fe0629fb3d78",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057403.json",
      "json_path": [
