      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fedf3279692f785a037c1c0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征表示有针对比赛拟定对策。\n另一方面，千明代表则是回答\n她打算自由地奔跑，所以事先没决定任何事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c21bff40bacb7b4b9c66fd323ffa4ceed2b9a0f7390b025088aa1df3b14dacd8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057403.json",
      "json_path": [
