    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15762d1d54d6911eeb858ccc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛最后由葛城王牌拿下第一名。\n千明代表以第十名惨败。\n虽然觉得不甘心，但她看起来并不消沉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "745f364f0863b022d2b34fb0951f8fd7d82b0a53c683a2588327c77a329076f6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
