    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f89ea561909f14565cf1d6b5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "世间掀起一股风潮，认为只有鲁道夫象征\n能够开创新时代。并认为不是为了赢得胜利\n而参赛的千明代表无法缔造历史。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a08b2075e78798414f26cf29dba5fbb700ad626f8613438dd68222328ceb320",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
