      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为她和训练员约好了。千明代表说道，\n因为有“一直是能让你看见梦想的千明代表”\n这个约定，她才能够变强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aab6ce0c6ed088f07029c45925722fdb95502399f8067e7b6e178c5280e02c0b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057404.json",
      "json_path": [
