      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而她今后也会按照自己的想法去比赛。\n正因为她是这样的赛马娘，粉丝才会为之疯狂，\n并想透过她的比赛来追求梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4b68c324b57ebf8f5545a654db781febbc51a5c0c927dc07da6d0199db33068",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
