      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某天晚上。\n千明代表和训练员遇见了经营频道的青年。\n他因为千明代表的事情和一名男性起了口角。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1968fa34e1f842a8db591d35400938fd4fa59258f1bd640bace1e249575279e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
