      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千明代表说青年是期盼她能成为\n他理想中的赛马娘，并表示\n他想怎么看比赛都是他的自由。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83fc445935446060b1f661ccdf2dcc9cbb9566c9081408373a24776eee84a862",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
