    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20dadfbebc0a20ae8d037adc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "根本没有办法证实哪一方比较强。\n但青年表示粉丝还是会忍不住要说\n自己支持的赛马娘才是最强的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f55e1a94a0525a90db0548c5aa90b1329ec8f8d3b51d00645001f286919d87e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
