    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f15d31cdb52f190b4b5b69cb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，千明代表完全不在意这件事，\n她表示自己只会继续随心所欲地奔跑。\n──于是，今年的夏季集训就此揭开序幕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04eb35fd59aba0b51f694bffcf918b31822880bf5df8d830dd6712b0ae3a4397",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
