      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d498a8a6abe5fce4d57b98b1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今年也到了夏季集训的季节。\n丸善斯基很高兴能和千明代表住同一间房，\n整个人显得非常兴奋。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8209b1c4356630c9539b009afb9d8708f4289d8ace1b8f46fd263e9827b21742",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42c8fdedaa6163b13c6194cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人才刚抵达集训宿舍，\n就立刻照自己的步调去找狸猫的巢穴了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02060e3185bdc071593af3973d326537b0dfa965e907af9954307c710df76648",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
