      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "世人早已开始关注千明代表，\n并期待她能大展身手。\n然而，她完全不在意这些事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f54a827127362ebc035a813bbade82a0de3fd33b9f157bf7e7bacacbd28d8bc",
