      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征将在一年后出道。\n千明代表主动与其握手，和她约好到时候\n要一决胜负后，就开心地准备上场比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8d70b07b3ef6a5f02d4042c7811977aab82627a85a74bd349fc7d48ad860a6c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
