      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛当天。观众们都期待千明代表获胜。\n葛城王牌为此感到高兴，\n显得干劲十足。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f3d8b74becc9c87332d1c75b238e314e19f2aa48ae62c59e7605a98d390a839",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
